  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National programme on Eco-Industrial Parks (EIP) in PR China</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the project is to establish a national programme of Eco-Industrial Parks in PR China. The project aims to promote the gr eening of industry in China through the uptake of resource efficient and cleaner production (RECP) concepts,methods, practices and policies. This will lead to decreased resource use and pollution thereby slowing down environmental degradation, contributing to climate change mitigation and enhancing the productivity and competitiveness of industry.</narrative>
  </description>
